  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One UN</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">One UN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN startade &quot;Delivering as One&quot; pilot aktiviteter i 2007 f&#xF6;r att b&#xE4;ttre anpassa FN till en v&#xE4;rld i f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring och f&#xF6;r att testa hur FM famijen can leverera bist&#xE5;nd p&#xE5; ett mer koordinerat s&#xE4;tt. Albanien &#xE4;r ett av 8 pilotl&#xE4;nder d&#xE4;r FN reformer genomf&#xF6;rs enligt fyra principer: &quot;One Leader, One Budget, One Programme and One Office.&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations launched the &quot;Delivering as One&quot; pilot initiatives in 2007 to respond to the challenges of a changing world and test how the UN family can provide development assistance in a more coordinated way. Albania is one of 8 pilot countries where UN reform is taking place based on four principles: One Leader, One Budget, One Programme and One Office.</narrative>
  </description>
